OL,3,GNEWSAAirport noise reduction plans
OL,4,A'nothing more than a tactic' -
OL,5,Aresidents
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn what has been described as a UK
OL,8,Ffirst, Leeds Bradford Airport has
OL,9,Foffered to contribute towards fitting
OL,10,Fair conditioning units in homes nearby
OL,11,Fin a bid to help reduce noise from
OL,12,Fnight-time flights. But what do those
OL,13,Fliving nearby make of the offer?
OL,15,F"Without detail, it's nothing more than
OL,16,Fa tactic to get planning permission,"
OL,17,Fclaims Ian Ditchfield.
OL,19,FSitting beside his wife, Susan, in
OL,20,Ftheir home in Horsforth, Ian says while
OL,21,Fthe plans may sound good in principle
OL,22,Fhe is not getting his hopes up yet.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
