OL,3,GNEWSAAirport noise reduction plans
OL,4,A'nothing more than a tactic' -
OL,5,Aresidents
OL,6,
OL,7,FSusan is equally unconvinced, branding
OL,8,Fthe offer as "just a headline" before
OL,9,Fgoing on to outline the impact on her
OL,10,Fsleep from night flights.
